DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260102
SUMMARY:Shōgatsu (Japanese New Year)
DESCRIPTION:The start of the new year\, Japan's most important family hol
 iday. Date: January 1 on the Gregorian calendar\, with observances over t
 he first days of January. Minnesota community parties (Shinnenkai) are se
 t by organizers each year. Source: Cabinet Office of Japan\, National Hol
 idays https://www8.cao.go.jp/chosei/shukujitsu/gaiyou.html Communities: J
 apanese Minnesota
