DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260102
SUMMARY:Karen New Year gathering in St. Paul
DESCRIPTION:The end of one rice harvest and the start of the next\; KOM c
 alls it the largest celebration in the Karen community. Organizers number
  the years\, with 2766 being the January 2027 gathering. Date: Minnesota 
 organizers announce the dates each year\, and they may not match the luna
 r day of Karen New Year. Source: Karen Organization of Minnesota\, Karen 
 New Year 2765 event page https://mnkaren.org/event/karen-new-year-2765/ C
 ommunities: Karen Minnesota
CATEGORIES:community festival
